      "content_markdown": "বা, $3^{mx-2} = a^{mx-2}$\n\nবা, $\\left(\\frac{a}{3}\\right)^{mx-2} = 1 = \\left(\\frac{a}{3}\\right)^0$\n\nবা, $mx - 2 = 0$\n\nবা, $mx = 2$\n\nবা, $x = \\frac{2}{m}$\n\n$\\therefore$ নির্ণেয় সমাধান $x = \\frac{2}{m}$",
      "activity_tag": null
